OL,3,ACambridge scientist dies in Spanish
OL,4,Atrain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA University of Cambridge scientist
OL,7,Fdied in the Spanish train disaster
OL,8,Fwhich killed at least 69 people, a
OL,9,Fresearch institute has confirmed.
OL,11,FDr Marta Shahbazi was travelling on one
OL,12,Fof the trains involved in the collision
OL,13,Fnear Urda, south of Madrid, according
OL,14,Fto the MRC Laboratory of Molecular
OL,15,FBiology (LMB) in the city, where she
OL,16,Fled a group of researchers.
OL,18,FThe University of Cambridge lists Dr
OL,19,FShahbazi as an affiliate associate
OL,20,Fprofessor.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
